# Cross-Asset Expansion Plan

**Status:** Draft — planning only, no implementation yet
**Date:** 2026-08-18
**Scope:** Expand ResearchOS from an XAUUSD-only research system into a system that can analyze any combination of assets (metals, energy, equities, indices, FX, crypto) using the existing evidence-first architecture.

---

## 1. Goal Statement

Turn the currently working XAUUSD pipeline (Data → Macro/Statistics → Backtest → Result) into a **generic, symbol-agnostic pipeline** that can run the same analysis and backtesting logic against any asset or combination of assets, while preserving the project's core guarantees: determinism, provenance, and evidence-first reasoning.

This is explicitly an **extension**, not a rebuild. Two internal audits (`CROSS_ASSET_READINESS.md`, `MACRO_OWNERSHIP_PROPOSAL.md`, both dated 2026-08-17) already confirmed that most of the computation layer (`quant_engine/`, `BacktestEngine`) is already asset-agnostic. This plan focuses on closing the remaining gaps, not redoing finished work.

