## 6. Explicit Non-Goals (for this plan)

- Not rebuilding `quant_engine/` — it is already asset-agnostic per audit.
- Not merging `macro_intelligence/` and `researchos/macro/` outright — that migration is separately planned, high-risk, and gated on parity evidence (see `MACRO_OWNERSHIP_PROPOSAL.md`).
- Not changing any formula in `metrics.py`, `performance.py`, `statistics.py` — flagged as "DO NOT CHANGE" in the existing audit.
- Not moving `fundamental/` (gold-specific analytics) out of `quant_engine/` — documented as intentional, not a blocker.

